{
  "name": "Auto-post RSS feed items to every social media platform",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Auto-post RSS feed items to every social media platform\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs automatically every 6 hours.\n2. Fetches the latest items from the RSS feed.\n3. Publishes posts to X (Twitter), Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, LinkedIn, and Facebook via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Set the RSS feed URL to your own feed.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n\n### Customization\n\nPoint the RSS node at a different feed to reuse the workflow for another blog or channel. Remove the Publish nodes you do not need to target fewer platforms. Adjust the trigger interval to control exactly how often the workflow runs.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 546
      },
      "id": "23581e8d-b017-4744-8ee2-23cb6c9e05a9",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        40
      ]
    },
